 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kitai No Akujo, Mitabime no Jinsei De Musai Muno o Tanoshimu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "稀代の悪女、三度目の人生で【無才無能】を楽しむ"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Enjoy Being Talentless"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In her first life, she was a legendary villainess known for being utterly talentless. In her second life, she lived as an ordinary Japanese woman until the age of 86. And now, in her third life, she has been reborn as a 16-year-old noblewoman—but with the wisdom of someone who has lived over a century!\nInstead of chasing power or influence, she chooses to embrace her lack of talent—ignoring the scorn of her family and mocking her fiancé, who looks down on her. After all, she knows that hiding her true abilities might be far more entertaining—and useful—than anyone expects!\nWill she be able to live peacefully as planned, or will her hidden talents once again drag trouble her way?\n\nA witty and comedic tale where our heroine masterfully manipulates those around her while trying to enjoy a quiet life… or at least, that’s what she hopes for!"
  },
